title: Compass Needle
text: The QUANTUM TANGLER sends a beam out both ways at once, and the two halves stay linked: when a doppler changes the colour of one, the other changes too, the opposite way. Paint the needle red at the north end and blue at the south.
trick: entangled twin
motif: compass needle
ink: 2.5
---
L 4 7 2 g
*Q 7 7 0 k
D 7 5 6 k
T 7 2 0 r
T 7 12 0 b
